title: "HNTD search: from the form to the shortlist"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: waiting
    lg1: running
    lg2: done
    lg3: failed
    lg4: gone
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 orange
  class lg4 purple
  s0: No search yet
  s1: In queue
  s2: Deleted
  s3: In queue, the pipeline is preparing
  s4: Deleted, the pipeline still works on it
  s5: Failed
  s6: Processing
  s7: Completed, shortlist shown
  s8: In queue, a run still works on it
  s9: Processing, no pipeline run alive
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you start a search
  s1 --> s3: a pipeline run reads the queue
  s3 --> s1: the Claude Code session ends mid-run
  s3 --> s5: the run reports a failure
  s3 --> s6: the run starts searching GitHub
  s4 --> s2: the run stops, the search is gone
  s5 --> s1: you reset it from the terminal
  s6 --> s5: the run reports a failure
  s6 --> s7: the run delivers the shortlist
  s6 --> s4: you delete the search
  s6 --> s8: the watchdog requeues it [30 minutes in processing] or you reset it from the terminal
  s6 --> s9: the Claude Code session ends mid-run
  s7 --> s1: you reset it from the terminal
  s8 --> s1: the Claude Code session ends mid-run
  s8 --> s5: the run reports a failure
  s8 --> s7: the run delivers the shortlist
  s9 --> s1: the watchdog requeues it [30 minutes in processing] or you reset it from the terminal
